{
  "total_duration": 702.338,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.472,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果一辆车瞬间开到"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "304 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，算不算破纪录？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 6.822,
      "end": 13.43,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不一定，因为速度纪录看的不是某一秒最快，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "average speed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 13.78,
      "end": 19.747,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Bluebird"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是普通汽车，而是专门为速度纪录制造的车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 20.097,
      "end": 29.497,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "300 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "大约是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "480 kilometers per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，快得几乎不像日常驾驶。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 29.847,
      "end": 34.807,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天我们学一个关于速度、测量、风险控制和父子传承的故事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 35.157,
      "end": 37.437,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看地点和目标。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 37.787,
      "end": 49.21,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：伟大的赛车手 Malcolm Campbell 爵士，在 Utah 的 Bonneville Salt Flats 挑战超过"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "300 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的世界纪录。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 49.56,
      "end": 57.748,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The great racing driver, Sir Malcolm Campbell, was the first man to drive at over 300 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 58.098,
      "end": 63.71,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "racing driver"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是赛车手，不是普通司机。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 64.06,
      "end": 72.74,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个地点是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Bonneville Salt Flats, Utah"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，一片开阔平坦的盐滩纪录场地，不是马路。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 73.09,
      "end": 82.309,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the first man to drive at over 300 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，还有"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "set up a new world record"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 82.659,
      "end": 85.219,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，看这辆车为什么特别。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 85.569,
      "end": 94.217,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Campbell 开的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Bluebird"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是专门为他制造的，车身很长，发动机马力巨大。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 94.567,
      "end": 100.115,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Bluebird, the car he was driving, had been specially built for him"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 100.465,
      "end": 107.52,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Had been specially built"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "表示在挑战纪录之前，这辆车已经被专门制造好了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 107.87,
      "end": 114.846,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文还说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "It was over 30 feet in length and had a 2,500-horsepower engine"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 115.196,
      "end": 121.116,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这不是普通家用车，而是工程团队为极限速度做出来的纪录车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 121.466,
      "end": 124.386,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，看最高速度和危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 124.736,
      "end": 135.248,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Campbell 一度达到超过"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "304 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，但第一次行驶中轮胎爆裂，他很难控制汽车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 135.598,
      "end": 144.074,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Although Campbell reached a speed of over 304 miles per hour, he had great difficulty in controlling the car"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 144.423,
      "end": 151.007,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Although"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先说速度惊人，主句却提醒我们控制很困难。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 151.357,
      "end": 155.717,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "原因是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "because a tyre burst during the first run"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 156.067,
      "end": 164.883,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Tyre"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是英式拼法，美式常写"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "tire"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "；这里跟课文用"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "tyre"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 165.233,
      "end": 168.033,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，看纪录结果和传承。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 168.382,
      "end": 183.542,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：他先失望地得知平均速度只有"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "299 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "；几天后才知道算错了，正确平均速度是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "301 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 183.892,
      "end": 191.192,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Campbell was disappointed to learn that his average speed had been 299 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 191.542,
      "end": 195.526,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后来："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "he was told that a mistake had been made"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 195.876,
      "end": 209.775,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这就解释了为什么"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "304"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "、"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "299"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "301"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可以同时出现在故事里：一个是最高速度，另一个是平均速度。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 210.125,
      "end": 220.441,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "结尾是传承："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Following in his father's footsteps"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，Donald Campbell 后来也驾驶一辆叫"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Bluebird"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "的车创造纪录。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 220.791,
      "end": 224.576,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，Campbell 是不是只是在开车开得特别快？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 224.926,
      "end": 234.206,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。这里是 controlled land-speed-record attempt，是受控的陆地速度纪录挑战，不是普通道路上开快车。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 234.556,
      "end": 238.361,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "为什么一定要在"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Bonneville Salt Flats"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 238.711,
      "end": 249.511,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为盐滩很平、很开阔，适合专业团队做测量和安全控制。普通道路有交通、行人和弯道，完全不是一回事。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 249.86,
      "end": 256.622,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "kilometers per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "怎么理解？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 256.972,
      "end": 269.724,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Mile"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是英美常用距离单位；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "kilometer"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是我们更熟悉的公里。粗略记："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "one mile is about 1.6 kilometers"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 270.074,
      "end": 277.994,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "300 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就大约是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "480 kilometers per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 278.344,
      "end": 283.784,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。这个换算只是帮你感受速度，不是让这课变成数学练习。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 284.133,
      "end": 294.955,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "我还是不懂，他都 reached over"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "304 miles per hour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "了，为什么听到"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "299"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "会失望？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 295.305,
      "end": 308.085,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "reached a speed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是某一段里的最高速度，record 要看"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "average speed"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。平均速度低于三百，就没有过那条心理和纪录线。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 308.435,
      "end": 312.418,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后来为什么又变成"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "301"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 312.768,
      "end": 320.516,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a mistake had been made"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。速度纪录要靠测量和计算，结果可以被重新检查。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 320.865,
      "end": 323.628,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "轮胎爆裂听起来很危险。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 323.978,
      "end": 331.378,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "非常危险。所以这课不是在鼓励孩子追求快，而是在尊重工程、测量和风险控制。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 331.728,
